msgctxt "Addon Summary"
msgid "Commodore - Amiga (PUAE)"
msgstr "Commodore - Amiga (PUAE)"

msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid "UAE stands for the Ubiquitous Amiga Emulator.[CR][CR]Most games require a version of the Amiga Kickstart ROM. However, some old games will work with the built-in ROM emulation."
msgstr "UAE znamená Ubiquitous Amiga Emulator.[CR][CR]Většina her vyžaduje některou verzi ROM Amiga Kickstart. Některé staré hry ale fungují i s vestavěnou emulací ROM."

